commonEntries -- lists of positions, where they coincide up to threshold
************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        (P1,P2)=commonEntries(L1,L2)
  * Inputs:
      * L1, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, 
      * L2, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, descending lists of non-negative
        real numbers
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * Threshold (missing documentation) => a *note real number:
        (Macaulay2Doc)RR,, default value .0001, relative error allowed for
        equality
