laplacians -- compute the laplacians of a chain complex
*******************************************************

  * Usage: 
        delta=laplacians C
  * Inputs:
      * C, a *note complex: (Complexes)Complex,, defined over RR
  * Outputs:
      * delta, a *note hash table: (Macaulay2Doc)HashTable,, of the laplacians

Description
===========

