Caveat
======

The algorithm does not produces the closest nearby complex in the euclidean
norm. Instead it is a reminder to develop such function.

See also
========

  * *note SVDComplex: SVDComplex, -- Compute the SVD decomposition of a chain
    complex over RR

Ways to use projectToComplex:
=============================

  * "projectToComplex(Complex,HashTable)"

For the programmer
==================

